SUMMARY:12/6 St. Nick Day Walk in Waynesville from Mast General to Middle 
 School & Back
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nIt's time for childlike w
 onder. Let's do a St. Nicholas Day walk in Waynesville and see the Christm
 as decorations.\n\nMeet at 2:00 in front of Mast General Store\, 63 N. Mai
 n St.\, Waynesville NC 28786. We will meet at the rocking chairs in front 
 of the door to the shoe department.\n\nThe walk goes past public art\, to 
 Frog Level for a brief stop at Panacea Coffee Company\, to Waynesville Mid
 dle School\, through an interesting neighborhood\, and back to the start p
 oint.\n\nThere are some hills\, so some may want a walking pole (I will ta
 ke 2)\; sneakers should be fine. Dogs are welcome. Strollers should be ok.
  Bring plenty of water and a protein snack. Dress appropriately for the we
 ather. Consider a hat and\, even though it is December\, sunscreen.\n\nPar
 king is easier a block to either side of Main Street. Mast General Store d
 oesn't have a public restroom\, but we can direct you to one nearby should
  you need it. There are one or two restrooms along the route.
